  "technique_summary": "Two-part nested shell: sub=4 icosphere inner waveguide core (INNER_R=48mm, smooth, Transmission Weight=0.92 IOR=1.49) + sub=2 icosphere outer decorative shell (OUTER_R=50mm, flat-shaded, WALL_MM=2mm); LED cavity via BooleanModifier EXACT solver (CAVITY_R=2.7mm CAVITY_DEPTH=8mm) at −Z pole; 6×Ø2mm drainage holes at lat=55° below equator (> 47.8° TIR safety margin for n=1.49); overhang analysis via face.normal.z tagged as FLOAT named attribute 'overhang'; STL export via bpy.ops.wm.stl_export global_scale=1000 (m→mm) forward_axis='Y' up_axis='Z' ascii_format=False; GLB preview Draco L6 WebP Y-up; TIR critical angle θ_c=arcsin(1/1.49)≈42.2°"
